  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Good job, seems like it lost interest.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: Megaphone
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: You'll be needing to use those shutters a lot out here.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: Megaphone
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: That was the last guy that worked here. As you can see, being out here has an effect on you.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: Megaphone
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "Anyway, the shift's over. I'm unlocking the door for you. Take out the trash on your way out."
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: Megaphone
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "... Not bad for a first day. Maybe you'll last longer than the last guy did."
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: Megaphone
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
